      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "LI Ch'ang-kêng 李長庚 (T. 超人, 西巖), May 1, 1750–1808, Jan. 12, naval commander and first Earl Chuang-lieh (壯烈伯), was a native of T'ung-an, Fukien. A military chin-shih of 1771, he was commissioned a junior Imperial Bodyguard.",
